# Two accounts, each able to do only its half of the exchange.
#
# The ESP32's credentials are compiled into firmware sitting in a flat, so
# assume they can be extracted. With this split, whoever has them can watch
# state and receive jobs, but cannot publish a job -- so they cannot make the
# printer print. A single shared account would let them.

user backend
topic write fax/+/job/+
topic read  fax/+/state
topic read  fax/+/ack/+

user printer
topic read  fax/+/job/+
topic write fax/+/state
topic write fax/+/ack/+
